{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 168, "line_no": 22, "text": "一、家庭的产生、构成与特点", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1710, "w": 494, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一、家庭的产生、构成与特点", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1710, "w": 494, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 168, "line_no": 23, "text": "布依族家庭的产生和发展，与整个人类社会发展同步，经历了母权制时期和父权制", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1770, "w": 1459, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族家庭的产生和发展，与整个人类社会发展同步，经历了母权制时期和父权制", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1770, "w": 1459, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 168, "line_no": 24, "text": "前期的大家族。到了父权制后期，随着私有制的形成，原始公社解体，对偶和专偶婚形态", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1831, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "前期的大家族。到了父权制后期，随着私有制的形成，原始公社解体，对偶和专偶婚形态", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1831, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 168, "line_no": 25, "text": "出现，诞生了父系个体家庭，延续至今。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1903, "w": 671, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "出现，诞生了父系个体家庭，延续至今。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1903, "w": 671, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 168, "line_no": 26, "text": "布依族家庭大都以传统的父系血缘为结构，家庭特点有以下几种类型：", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1959, "w": 1226, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族家庭大都以传统的父系血缘为结构，家庭特点有以下几种类型：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1959, "w": 1226, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 168, "line_no": 27, "text": "多重性家庭、复合性家庭和单一性家庭。", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 2032, "w": 696, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "多重性家庭、复合性家庭和单一性家庭。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 2032, "w": 696, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 168, "line_no": 28, "text": "在布依族社会，这三种类型家庭同时并存。过去，以复合性家庭为主，后来单一性家", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 2092, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在布依族社会，这三种类型家庭同时并存。过去，以复合性家庭为主，后来单一性家", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 2092, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 168, "line_no": 29, "text": "庭逐渐普遍，多重性家庭则以一种特殊形式存在着。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2156, "w": 909, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "庭逐渐普遍，多重性家庭则以一种特殊形式存在着。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2156, "w": 909, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
